              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "atikāriyiṉ kaṭṭaḷaiyai ellōrum piṉpaṟṟiṉārkaḷ. — Everyone followed the officer's order.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *atikāriyiṉ kaṭṭaḷaiyai ellōrum piṉpaṟṟiṉārkaḷ.* — Everyone followed the officer's order.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
