              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடுமையான — kaṭumaiyāṉa — \"strict; severe\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விதிகளை மீறினால் கடுமையான அபராதம் உண்டு. vitikaḷai mīṟiṉāl kaṭumaiyāṉa aparātam uṇṭu. If you break the rules, there is a severe fine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From the noun கடுமை, harshness, with -ஆன. As an adverb: கடுமையாக உழை, to work hard."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடுமையான (kaṭumaiyāṉa) is native Dravidian, the -ஆன adjective of கடுமை (kaṭumai), \"severity, harshness\", which DEDR 1135 gives under கடு, \"to throb, to smart\"."
            }
          ]
        },
