          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கைரேகை (kairēkai) joins the native கை (kai), \"a hand\", and ரேகை (rēkai), \"a line\", from Sanskrit rekhā, \"a scratch, a line\" (CDIAL 10810)."
            }
          ]
        },
